<title>PHILIPPINES: PCIBank says sees 1996 net at 2.8 bln.</title>
<headline>PCIBank says sees 1996 net at 2.8 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>PCIBank said on Friday its sees a net income of 2.8 billion pesos in 1996 against the 2.30 billion pesos recorded in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;We've met our target,&quot; PCIBank president Rafael Buenaventura told reporters.</p>
</text>
